{
    "title": "Stripe Dashboard",
    "description": "Run your business on the go with the Stripe Dashboard app. Monitor your Stripe accounts securely in real-time and accept payments anywhere\u2014all from your mobile device.\r\n\r\nTrack performance\r\n \u2022 View your revenue, payments, balances, and payouts\r\n \u2022 Compare current business performance to historical data \r\n\r\nAccept payments\r\n \u2022 Accept in-person payments manually or using Tap to Pay\r\n \u2022 Send invoices to your customers\r\n\r\nManage your business\r\n \u2022 Check your balance and pay out funds\r\n \u2022 Issue full or partial refunds, investigate failed payments, and more\r\n \u2022 Look up customers, payments, and invoices\r\n\r\nStay informed\r\n \u2022 Opt in to receive daily business summaries via push notification\r\n \u2022 Get instant notifications about new payments and customers\r\n\r\nAccount required. Sign up at\r\nhttps://www.stripe.com/register",
